  "confirmedGenericContract": [
    "Generic getPresetSearchDataKeys excludes display_state=false fields and includes selectable-group targets, deduplicated by property ID.",
    "Collection uses DMC property access and data-type initialization for missing values, not plain-object serialization.",
    "SavePresetDataModelProgram collects criteria plus name/default/sequence/current-template/sort/data-view/sub-menu fields and runs search validation. It returns a data model rather than persisting it.",
    "SavePresetAndSearchUserAction dispatches the menu search first and then delegates saving to missing preset module (standard or set-menu user action).",
    "SearchPresetDataModelProgram resets default criteria before overlay, only applies allowed property IDs, resolves nonliteral relative dates, and restores template/sort/data-view/active-tab with preservation guards. Server execution and UI binding are unverified."
  ],
  "currentImplementation": "Deployed requestList.snapshot/restore stores current applied/pending criteria, selection, stage and scroll/page for in-memory screen restoration; no named persistent search favorites. This is not proof of My-tab equivalence.",
  "remaining": [
    "Full official manual010/011 and readonly actual My-tab entry/edit/rename/default/reorder/remove/apply/cancel UI, including field labels and constraints.",
    "Actual preset$ISavePresetUserAction / set-menu module and persistence/authorization contract are absent in currently cached files. Do not treat generic common helpers as the My-tab implementation.",
    "Per-company/user/menu scope, sharing/default selection, concurrency/history, name/number limits, relative date policy and compatibility with hidden/custom fields and selected list forms.",
    "Confirm which generic common preset paths are actually bound to purchase request/plan/order/purchase My-tab screens before implementation."
  ],
